      "content": "That's a great vibe, thanks. I actually need a few more bullet points for the brand's blog post to back this up. Can you give me some of the main reasons why traditional structures are better for a kid's development? Like, can you give me some solid points I can use to show why they have an advantage over more modern, less stable setups?",
